        <activityName xml:lang="en">Footpath, gravel pavement, complete pavement structure</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Footpath, gravel pavement, complete pavement structure
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 78bdc924-e888-46b3-a274-5cd425cba9cc
This dataset combines the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of all layer types of 1 m2 gravel footpath in Switzerland. Service life 30 years
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Width 1.5 m incl. foundation; curbstones 12×30 cm; concrete foundation 20×25 cm with curbstone embedded 15 cm centrally. layers: 15 cm reused excavation, 20 cm crushed stone/ gravel, 5 cm fine gravel as surface layer; Based on assumptions.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_78bdc924-e888-46b3-a274-5cd425cba9cc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
